  "goodToKnow": "Die Romantik is both an epoch and a mood. The epoch (around 1795 to 1850) is the German movement of poetry, painting and music with Novalis, Eichendorff, the Brothers Grimm, Caspar David Friedrich and Schumann. The mood is the romance of a candlelit dinner. German Romantiker loved forests, the Middle Ages and longing (Sehnsucht). Die Romantische Straße in Bavaria is a tourist route."
